hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:546b4da64119b5353ac3dc0c8ae447d3d7d66621253d063429cd3c8f2fbf9fa6","file":"preprints/Weak-pure-infiniteness-and-O-infinity-absorption-September-25-2026/build/introduction.tex","line":73,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"c601d6fd4ad43a2cd6c7206258b463ee91b4df60ccd0f96486a0cef8b90a212e","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Weak-pure-infiniteness-and-O-infinity-absorption-September-25-2026/build/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:546b4da64119b5353ac3dc0c8ae447d3d7d66621253d063429cd3c8f2fbf9fa6","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Weak-pure-infiniteness-and-O-infinity-absorption-September-25-2026/build/introduction.tex#L73"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:individual-to-strong}\nLet \\(C\\) be a complex \\(C^*\\)-algebra satisfying \\(\\propP\\).\nFor all \\(a,b\\in C_+\\), \\(c\\in C\\), and \\(\\varepsilon>0\\), there are\n\\(s,t\\in C\\) such that\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:main-diagonalization}\n \\|s^*as-a\\|<\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n \\|t^*bt-b\\|<\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n \\|s^*ct\\|<\\varepsilon.\n\\end{equation}\nConsequently \\(C\\) is strongly purely infinite."}
